        "content": "No. A backlog permanently disqualifies you from Honours. To earn Honours you must (a) finish with a CGPA ≥ 8.5 **and** (b) pass every course on the first attempt with no backlogs, failures, or repeats. If any backlog exists, Honours is not attainable, regardless of your final CGPA."
